Current Task: Premise: A delivery rider realizes every address on today's route belongs to someone who died in the same building. Serial: "The Dead Drop". A gig-economy delivery rider discovers his route consists entirely of addresses belonging to people who died in the same luxury high-rise—triggering a conspiracy that turns his GPS into a map of a mass murder.
The serial will be written in the same language as the premise above. List 100 to 150 filler words of that language: the common function words (articles, pronouns, prepositions, conjunctions, auxiliary verbs, basic adverbs such as "now" or "still") that carry no plot meaning. A repetition checker will ignore these words when it compares episode summaries, so do not include nouns, names, places, or verbs that describe events. All words lowercase, one word per item, no duplicates.


This is the expected criteria for your final answer: The language name and the list of filler words.
you MUST return the actual complete content as the final answer, not a summary.
Format your final answer according to the following OpenAPI schema: {
  "properties": {
    "language": {
      "title": "Language",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "words": {
      "description": "Lowercase filler/function words of the language the serial is written in",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Words",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "language",
    "words"
  ],
  "title": "FillerWords",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false
}

IMPORTANT: Preserve the original content exactly as-is. Do NOT rewrite, paraphrase, or modify the meaning of the content. Only structure it to match the schema format.

